        "result_id": "31059f0fa2566cc9040f813680a3c827f41c49f07db6b5885e040a0ed48b8bb5"
      },
      "changed": "Corrected evidence triggers fresh validation and scoped A review; independent human approval then enables only the bounded mock path.",
      "stayed": "Prior Root final immutable; B blocked, shipment held; semantic proposals and receipts never grant action authority.",
      "owners": "Explicit human approval and local Root own the bounded action. Warehouse, legal, accounting, supplier and bank-policy branches supply different evidence. Public summaries do not establish a separately named Root instance for every branch.",
      "useful_outcome": "Supplier A mock path PASS with business_outcome MIXED, not all-business PASS.",
      "lawful_neighbor": "S-P1 scoped human approval followed by S-P2 mock Bank Corridor",
      "adverse_neighbor": "S-F1 no human approval; no packet execution or receipt. S-F2/S-F3 separately test widened packet and receipt-as-permission mutations.",
